    "body": "Raised from P7 to P6 (mkinney, 2026-11-15). The user runs a Tormach 770MX with a microARC 4 and wants continuous 4-axis (wrapping). The #1904 walkthrough found this refusal blocks the continuous half (\"simultaneous 4-axis motion ... not confirmed on PathPilot\"). To get the missing confirmation, mkinney will run a hand-written continuous-A test kit in the PathPilot Hub 770MX simulator with the 4th axis enabled: A rollover, feed with combined X+A moves, G93 inverse time, and a wrapped groove and helix. The results go on this issue.",
